{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8f2c1d4-7a3e-4f61-9c2b-5d8e1a3f6c07",
    "name": "工业智能体平台 · 设备中心 API",
    "description": "设备中心 7 组接口的完整测试集合。\n\n## 使用步骤\n1. 先跑 **00 登录**，脚本会自动把 token 写进集合变量 `{{token}}`。\n2. 其余请求都带了 `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`，无需手动粘贴。\n3. 按 01→07 顺序跑，后面的请求依赖前面创建的 `{{equipmentId}}`。\n\n## 前置条件\n- 后端已启动：http://localhost:8080\n- MySQL 已灌入 seed 数据（database/db_change_equipment_and_seed.sql）\n- 账号：admin / 123456（系统管理员，拥有全部设备权限）\n\n## 权限矩阵\n| 接口 | ADMIN | MANAGER | OPERATOR |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 查询类 | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| 新增/删除 | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| 修改 | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| 上报运行数据 | ✓ | ✗ | ✓ |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "equipmentId", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 登录（获取 token）",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('登录成功', () => { pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200); });",
              "if (body.data && body.data.token) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.data.token);",
              "  console.log('token 已写入集合变量');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
        "description": "登录拿 JWT。成功后会写入集合变量 {{token}}。"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "01 设备列表 · 分页",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('业务码 200', () => pm.expect(body.code).to.eql(200));",
              "pm.test('返回分页对象', () => {",
              "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('total');",
              "  pm.expect(body.data).to.have.property('list');",
              "  pm.expect(body.data.list).to.be.an('array');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('total = 48', () => pm.expect(body.data.total).to.eql(48));",
              "pm.test('分页生效（返回 5 条）', () => pm.expect(body.data.list.length).to.eql(5));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/equipment?page=1&size=5",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "equipment"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
            { "key": "size", "value": "5" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "传 page 参数 → 返回分页对象 {total,page,size,pages,list}。"
      }
    },
